Note on severity badge labels: web SEVERITY_LABEL is a hardcoded English map (ok/warn/critical/"—"). For ADR-014
zero-hardcoded-text compliance these are i18n-sourced as translation_admin_diskForecast_severityOk/Warn/Critical
(unknown → em-dash, web SEVERITY_LABEL.unknown). These 3 helper strings are additive and not part of the 32-item
manifest count. Units (binary-prefix bytes / days-to-quota / share-of-total %) are formatted only at the display
boundary (DiskForecastFormats), mirroring web formatBytes / fmtNumber — no non-SI value is stored or computed (S5).

